# Sprite-generation tooling (tools/sprite-gen/, see its README/comments) and
# the cloned Origins Asset Kit reference repo (tools/axie-origins-asset-kit/)
# are dev-only build tools, not shipped game code — and the asset kit's own
# LICENSE.md restricts redistribution outright. Only the final PNGs this
# pipeline produces (copied into public/sprites/units/, public/sprites/
# enemies/, and public/backgrounds/, which ARE tracked) are meant to ship.
tools/axie-origins-asset-kit/
tools/sprite-gen/node_modules/
tools/sprite-gen/public/starters/
tools/sprite-gen/public/pve-starters.json
tools/sprite-gen/public/chimeras/
tools/sprite-gen/public/pve-chimeras.json
tools/sprite-gen/public/bg-source/
tools/sprite-gen/output/

# Scraped fan-reference guides used for reconciliation (see
# docs/DEVELOPMENT_BASELINE.md's own reference hierarchy) — same treatment
# as the Origins Asset Kit above: local-only, not redistributed. Their
# distilled facts live in DEVELOPMENT_BASELINE.md's reconciliation table.
docs/reference/

# Treasure charm tier-generator (tools/treasure-gen/, see its README) — raw
# downloaded charm source images and the bronze/silver/gold PNGs it
# generates from them are a local working area, not shipped game code.
# Only the final chosen icons, once copied into public/treasures/, are
# tracked (same treatment as tools/sprite-gen/output/ below).
tools/treasure-gen/node_modules/
tools/treasure-gen/input/*
tools/treasure-gen/output/*
!tools/treasure-gen/input/.gitkeep
!tools/treasure-gen/output/.gitkeep

# User-supplied source dump of Axie Origins Charm marketplace art (the full
# roster tools/treasure-gen's chosen 36 were copied from) — not shipped
# game code, same treatment as the raw charm images above.
Axie Origins Charms/
